# Staged workflows

These workflow files are generated by the template and staged here. A human
must copy them into `.github/workflows/` using credentials with the
`workflow` scope:

    cp -r staged/.github/workflows .github/workflows
    git add .github/workflows
    git commit -m "ci: add generated workflows"
    git push
